cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "pci: Probabilistic Compositional Inference for coupled engineered systems"
abstract: >-
  Distributed state and parameter estimation for systems of coupled subsystems.
  Each subsystem keeps its own physics, unknown parameters and Kalman-type
  estimator; subsystems exchange interface messages on a graph under a
  Jacobi or Gauss-Seidel schedule, so no global augmented state or covariance
  is ever assembled.
